{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/mr-c-residences-ignazio-maggio-cipriani-downtown-dubai","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":94,"crm_id":"4029","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Mr C Residences","slug":"mr-c-residences-ignazio-maggio-cipriani-downtown-dubai","display_address":"Downtown Dubai","building_type":["apartment","branded"],"completion_year":"2026","developer":"Alta Developer","price":8100000,"display_price":"8.1M","lattitude":25.1959545,"longitude":55.274397,"min_bedrooms":null,"max_bedrooms":0,"display_bedrooms":"TBA","about":"<p>Discover a new pinnacle of luxury living with the upcoming Mr. C Residences <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/downtown-dubai/\">Downtown Dubai</a> by Ignazio and Maggio Cipriani. Developed by Alta Developer, it presents an exclusive selection of 2- to 4-bedroom residences in the heart of Downtown Dubai.</p><p>Set against the stunning backdrop of Downtown Dubai, residents will enjoy panoramic views of the Burj Khalifa, the Arabian Gulf, and the city skyline. The prime location ensures effortless access to renowned landmarks such as Dubai Mall, Dubai Opera, and the Dubai Fountain, offering a lifestyle of convenience and prestige.</p><p>A wealth of world-class amenities enhances the living experience, including a grand hotel-style pool, a state-of-the-art gym, dedicated yoga and Pilates rooms, an indoor spa with ice baths and saunas, a cutting-edge golf simulator, and an indoor running track with green meditation hubs.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Mr_C_Residences_at_Downtown_Dubai_by_Alta_Developer_4d8fc6d356.jpg","hash":"Mr_C_Residences_at_Downtown_Dubai_by_Alta_Developer_4d8fc6d356","name":"Mr. C Residences at Downtown Dubai by Alta Developer"},"banne