-of-the-art fitness center, yoga, and massage rooms</li><li>Private screening room, library lounge, outdoor movie theater, and indoor lap pool</li><li>Exclusive Mr. C lifestyle services such as valet, butler, housekeeping, and personalized concierge</li><li>Waterfront promenade access and serene landscaped spaces for a refined living experience</li><li>Developed by Alta, known for premium boutique developments that emphasize privacy and elegance</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1298,"cta":{"id":2066,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Mr_C_Residences_at_Downtown_Dubai_by_Alta_Developer_55895a37e1.jpg","hash":"Mr_C_Residences_at_Downtown_Dubai_by_Alta_Developer_55895a37e1","name":"Mr. C Residences at Downtown Dubai by Alta Developer"},"style":null,"title":"Mr. C Residences Downtown Dubai: Elegant Project in the Heart of Dubai","heading":"Location","bg_color":"blue","add_place":[],"image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<p>Mr. C Residences enjoys a prime location in Downtown Dubai, offering a refined urban lifestyle with seamless access to the city's most iconic landmarks. Just moments from Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall, residents are immersed in a world of luxury shopping, fine dining, and cultural attractions, including the nearby Dubai Opera. The development ensures effortless connectivity, with major highways and Dubai Metro providing easy access to every corner of the city. Set against stunning waterfront views, this prestigious address offers an unparalleled blend of sophistication, convenience, and cosmopolitan living.</p><ul><li>05 Minutes to DIFC</li><li>15 Minutes to Burj Khalifa</li><li>10 Minutes to Dubai International Airport</li><li>15 Minutes to Souk Al Bahar</li><li>15 Minutes to The Dubai Fountain</li><li>10 Minutes to The Dubai Mall</li><li>20 Minutes to Dubai Opera</li></ul>","design_title":null},"brochure":{"id":3542,"url":null,"file":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Mr_C_Residences_Downtown_Brochure_06b42ae952.pdf","hash":"Mr_C_Residences_Downtown_Brochure_06b42ae952","name":"Mr.-C-Residences-Downtown-Brochure.pdf"},"item":[],"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/General_Brochure_90d7160d65.png","hash":"General_Brochure_90d7160d65","name":"General"}},"video_module":{"id":2264,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":3205,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Mr_C_Residences_at_Downtown_Dubai_by_Alta_Developer_68e79a2dd4.jpg","hash":"Mr_C_Residences_at_Downtown_Dubai_by_Alta_Developer_68e79a2dd4","name":"Mr. C Residences at Downtown Dubai by Alta Developer"},"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment ","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":3206,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Mr_C_Residences_at_Downtown_Dubai_by_Alta_Developer_0f9f43f486.jpg","hash":"Mr_C_Residences_at_Downtown_Dubai_by_Alta_Developer_0f9f43f486","name":"Mr. C Residences at Downtown Dubai by Alta Developer"},"title":"3 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":3207,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/Mr_C_Residences_at_Downtown_Dubai_by_Alta_Developer_0c4131325f.jpg","hash":"Mr_C_Residences_at_Downtown_Dubai_by_Alta_Developer_0c4131325f","name":"Mr. C Residences at Downtown Dubai by Alta Developer"},"title":"4 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null}],"payment_plan_text":"40/60 ","payment_plans":[{"id":9461,"title":"40%","description":"During Construct