What makes Mr. C Residences Downtown Dubai a unique investment opportunity?"},{"id":5122,"answer":"<p>The development offers a range of luxurious 2- to 4-bedroom residences, each thoughtfully designed with expansive living spaces, high-end finishes, and private outdoor areas.<br>&nbsp;</p>","question":"What types of residences are available at Mr. C Residences, and what are their sizes?"},{"id":5123,"answer":"<p>Mr. C Residences is designed for a refined, resort-style living experience, offering an extensive selection of premium amenities, including:</p><p>Hotel-style swimming pool<br>State-of-the-art gym<br>Yoga and Pilates rooms<br>Indoor spa with ice baths and saunas<br>Golf simulator<br>Indoor running track with meditation hubs</p>","question":"What amenities are available to residents at Mr. C Residences?"},{"id":5124,"answer":"<p>Located in the heart of Downtown Dubai, Mr. C Residences offers seamless connectivity to the city’s most sought-after destinations. Residents are within minutes of:</p><p>Burj Khalifa – 15 minutes<br>Dubai Mall – 10 minutes<br>Dubai Opera – 20 minutes<br>DIFC (Dubai International Financial Centre) – 5 minutes<br>Dubai International Airport – 10 minutes<br>With easy access to major highways and Dubai Metro, residents can conveniently reach key business hubs and leisure attractions across the city.</p>","question":"Where is Mr. C Residences located?"},{"id":5125,"answer":"<p>The project is scheduled for completion by December 2026. A flexible 40/60 payment plan is available, allowing buyers to pay 40% during construction and 60% upon handover, making it an attractive option for both investors and end-users seeking luxury living in a prestigious address.</p>","question":"When is the expected handover, and what is the payment plan?"}],"virtual_tour_url":null,"permit_number":null,"country":"Dubai","documents":null,"future_launch":null,"adroll":0,"ggfx_results":[{"src_url":"i/Mr_C_Residences_Downtown_Dubai_37c336dc2a.jpg","src_cftle":"i/Mr_